  "title": "Chocolate Mocha Cake I",
  "description": "This is a one bowl cake. You can substitute sour milk for buttermilk - mix 1 cup milk with 1 tablespoon vinegar or lemon juice and let stand for 10 minutes. Frost with Coffee Icing.",
  "authors": [
